# GSP Recruitment — Caddyfile context (pointer doc)
#
# This file used to be the literal (informal) description of what the
# system Caddy instance (/etc/caddy/Caddyfile) serves. As of Fase 0.4 the
# real, deployed Caddyfile lives at ../infra/Caddyfile and is pushed to the
# VPS by .github/workflows/deploy.yml -- see infra/README.md for how that
# deploy step works, including its safety checks and rollback.
#
# Edit ../infra/Caddyfile, not this file, to change production routing.
#
# Note this file previously named the served path as
# /home/og/projects/gsp-recruitment/website (note: `og`, not `gsp`), which
# does not match the /home/gsp/projects/gsp-recruitment deploy dir used
# elsewhere in this repo's tooling. That discrepancy is carried forward
# unverified into infra/Caddyfile -- see infra/README.md "Known risk"
# section before relying on it.
